明时分的天空。天空的颜色从顶部的蓝色向下逐渐过渡到橙红色，再到底部的亮黄色，呈现出温暖的渐变效果。天空中还点缀着一些稀疏、轻薄的云彩，增加了画面的层次感和氛围感。\n\n- **颜色**：画面的色彩搭配和谐。人物身上的白色服装与背景中温暖的橙黄色天空形成了鲜明的对比，使人物形象更加突出。深紫色的头发则为画面增添了一抹冷色调，平衡了整体的暖色背景。\n\n- **光影**：光线似乎来自背景的远方，照亮了人物的面部和上半身，使她的轮廓清晰可见。这种布光方式让她的脸庞看起来柔和而立体。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 348, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 197, "type": "TextPreview", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TextPreview"}, "order": 30}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["填写提示词的地方\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [2427.8408203125, -792.9725952148438], "id": 73, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [180, 276, 354], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [946.3377685546875, 1419.0133056640625], "pos": [401.4895324707031, 477.6318664550781], "widgets_values": ["4995419670f6c9c14fb2119de9838ca90e915cd0bdd0272f106406a321c817c4.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 107, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "原图片", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.50", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "reel", "links": [150], "label": "reel